  #line-at(72pt, 83.28pt, "nearly unchanged, while the interfacial thermal resistance decreases markedly with pressure, ")
  #line-at(72pt, 103.92pt, "indicating an interface-dominated response. ")
  #line-at(96pt, 124.56pt, "These findings show that TIM properties under practical assembly conditions should not ")
